<title>UK: Lehman Brothers leads $100 million one-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers leads $100 million one-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers has lead-managed a $100 million one-year asset-backed floating rate note for Asset Backed Capital, rated triple-A by both Moody's and S&amp;P.</p>
<p>The coupon is three-month LIBOR minus 6.25 basis points and the issue and reoffer price is 100.10.</p>
<p>The full fees are 10 b.p. Pay date is July 8, 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
